      531.49
    ],
    "text": "As the requirement for restoration and reappointment of members to the Board of Management of the Western Provincial Road Passenger Transport Authority has arisen, as per the powers entrusted to me under Article 154 c and 154 f of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka and under Section 3(8) of the Road Passenger Transport Services Statute No. 01 of 1992 of the Western Provincial Council, as the Governor of Western Province, I do hereby announce that the following mentioned persons will be removed from the membership of the Board of Management of the Western Provincial Road Passenger Transport Authority.",
